000000r 1               ; ACIA receive reliability test (VICE / SwiftLink): the host sends a counting stream, the NMI poller
000000r 1               ; stores it in a 2 KB ring, the main loop verifies it.  Variables are read through the VICE monitor.
000000r 1               ACIA_DATA = $DE00
